Subject: [PATCH 02/02] crypto/algapi.c: honor fcw_skip_tests()

linux-esx does not need to run alg tests in non fips mode. Skip triggerring
them from algapi layer.

algboss.c within the canister boundary already handles fcw_skip_tests(),
without corresponding change in algapi.c we catch WARN_ON:

